        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>缓解痛经</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 552px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .status-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    height: 34px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    padding: 0 18px;\n  }\n  .status-bar .left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 3px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .status-bar .right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .status-bar .icon {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .close {\n    padding: 10px 0 0 32px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 32px;\n  }\n  .num-heading {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 16px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .num-badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 21px;\n    height: 21px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f4a08a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 21px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .num-title {\n    color: #e0704a;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #e6c9bd;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .section-block {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 78px 0 44px 0;\n  }\n  .section-box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #7b4fc4;\n    padding: 8px 26px 10px 26px;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .section-num {\n    color: #6b3fbf;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 0.95;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .section-name {\n    color: #6b3fbf;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-top: -6px;\n  }\n  .tag-arrow {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin: 8px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .tag-body {\n    background: #6b3fbf;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 7px 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .tag-tip {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    border-top: 17px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 17px solid transparent;\n    border-left: 14px solid #6b3fbf;\n    align-self: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"status-bar\">\n  <span class=\"left\"><span class=\"icon\">HD</span><span>&#9776;</span><span>&#128246;</span></span>\n  <span class=\"right\"><span class=\"icon\">&#9633;</span><span>19:43</span></span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"close\">&#10005;</div>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n\n  <div class=\"num-heading\">\n    <span class=\"num-badge\">5</span>\n    <span class=\"num-title\">月经来潮需停药</span>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <p>药物推迟月经可能会失败，服药过程中如月经来潮需停药。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-block\">\n    <div class=\"section-box\">\n      <div class=\"section-num\">2·</div>\n      <div class=\"section-name\">缓解痛经</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>如果上述方法推迟月经失败，对于痛经明显的，我们可以使用缓解痛经的方法来减少痛经对考试状态的影响。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"tag-arrow\">\n    <span class=\"tag-body\">常用方案</span>\n    <span class=\"tag-tip\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>痛经的发生与月经来潮时子宫内膜前列腺素含量增高有关，因此，可以通过服用前列腺素合成酶抑制剂来缓解痛经。</p>\n\n  <p>以下三种方法，选其中一种方法即可：</p>\n\n  <p>1.布洛芬 首剂 800 mg，之后根据需要 400～800 mg 每8小时一次，可在月经来潮前 1 天开始服用，连续服用 3 天。</p>\n\n  <p>2.甲芬那酸首剂 500 mg，之后根据需要 250 mg 每6小时一次。</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
